title The deepest body, and the accessor that names which shape a report answers
prompt Autonomous loop -- take the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first, close reds first, send each finished increment as its own signed round
think The ranked queue handed over hold_the_matter at 336. Measured before cutting: declared=10 identical=7 lines=59 stub=3 fall=336 widens=0 -- the deepest body the arc has met.
think Read the three that differ before calling any of them drift, since the lap before last taught exactly that. caravan/desist.rye reads report_out.walled directly where the seven reach it through desist_of. caravan/mind.rye and caravan/forbear.rye carry no walling clause at all -- eleven lines shorter -- because neither report holds a desisting sub-record to consult.
think Named the pattern rather than rediscovering it a fourth time. The sub-record accessor is what marks which report shape a rung answers: mind_of last lap, desist_of and forbear_of this one. A rung reaching a field directly rather than through an accessor is answering a different shape, and a lift that forced it into the family would publish a sub-record that rung deliberately does without. Written into the reach witness comment so the next lap reads it rather than deriving it.
think Lifted into caravan/ladder_checks.rye as pub fn hold_the_matter(comptime rung: type, io: std.Io, forbear: rung.Forbear, report_out: *rung.Report) (rung.RunError || rung.NoteError)!void, seated directly beneath the read_the_reply it runs after. Twenty-one call sites became rung-qualified -- desist_of, forbear_of, allay_of, address_published, addressable, recounted_to, rest_written, rests_rest, unhanded_matters, forborne_in, opened_in, rests_answers, forbear_refusal, forbear_note, forbear_holds, hold_standing, holds_bytes, max_address_len -- and all seven // invariant: asserts travelled with the body.
think Carry 59,810 -> 59,474, a fall of 336, the scan's predicted number to the digit. Ten laps running.
think Rotated the pins: folded row to hold_the_matter, queue head to answered_by at 330, sink 65,045 -> 64,653 total and 63,905 -> 63,513 above the line, farewell holding 3,801 -> 3,745.
think tools/caravan_ladder_copy_witness.rish refused the first narrative again, this time for one spelled fifty-nine no assert held. Second lap running that this guard has caught the record before the record shipped, which is the argument for having it.
obs The finding worth carrying is a rule the ladder has now stated three times in three laps, so it stops being an observation and becomes a written check: in this ladder a report comes in shapes, and the sub-record accessor is the marker of which shape a rung answers. mind_of, desist_of, forbear_of, allay_of -- a rung reaching a field through one of them and a rung reaching it directly are answering different structures, however identical the surrounding lines read. The identical-body meter already separates them correctly; what was missing was the reason, and a reason a reader must re-derive each lap is a blindness with a note attached.
obs The second observation is about the queue itself. answered_by now stands at the head with widens=68 -- the first row of this whole arc that would cost a widening, thirty-four function openings and thirty-four const openings. Every family lifted since the ranking landed has been free. The next lap is therefore the first that must weigh a fall against a price rather than simply take the top row, which is a different kind of decision and worth naming before it arrives.
